July 1992 — 11:30"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/693"} "Campo de Tiro Olímpico de Mollet, Mollet del Vallès"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/51832"} "44 from 29 countries"]]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "After the preliminary round only two points separated the first six shooters and the medal race was wide open. Eventually three shooters came down to the final shot to decide the medals – " [:a {:href "/athletes/41347"} "Konstantin Lukashik"] " (BLR), " [:a {:href "/athletes/41621"} "Wang Yifu"] " (CHN), and the 1972 gold medalist, " [:a {:href "/athletes/44276"} "Ragnar Skanåker"] " (SWE). Lukashik had a one-point lead over the other two and when all three scored in the 9-ring on the final shot, Lukashik had the gold medal. Wang won the silver over Skanåker based on a higher final round. Defending gold medalist, " [:a {:href "/athletes/43868"} "Sorin Babii"] " (ROM), placed fifth. " [:a {:href "/athletes/41434"} "Tanyu Kiryakov"] " (BUL) had been tied for first with Lukashik after the preliminary round. But he started out poorly and after his sixth shot, upset with his performance, slammed his pistol down hard and bent the sight. He skipped his final four shots and placed last among the finalists, eighth overall."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Preliminary Round"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "131"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/41347"} "Kanstantsin Lukashyk"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/EUN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/EUN.png"}] "EUN"]] [:td {} "567 (1)"] [:td {} "658 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style "